
Example edje.

Comment in the #includes in "programs" to get the expedition clock.

With edjes that send a lot of (timer-/animation-) signals, you will notice
a certain (CPU-) load.  This is believed to decrease noticably once we drop
GTK2.  The edje plugin is provided "early" in the hopes that it may facilitate
theming; load created by themes can only get lighter in future versions.



Background: http://phusion9.edesigns.nl/plus/walls1.html (version)

